{
  "bodyHash": "CV4ESiWfvag=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Easy Shulker Boxes</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 让你直接在背包中与潜影盒进行全面交互。无需将潜影盒放置在地上，即可放入物品、取出物品、浏览内容和管理存储空间。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">受 Minecraft 现代收纳袋机制启发，本模组让便携存储变得自然且直观。滚动浏览存储内容 🖱️，精确选择你想要的物品 🎯，通过简单的点击移入或移出物品，使用鼠标拖拽在多个格子间批量转移，或使用单物品模式进行精细的库存管理。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了原版潜影盒，本模组还支持末影箱，并可通过数据包扩展来兼容其他模组的存储物品。🔗</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">与简单的提示框模组不同，这不是一个仅客户端模组。它增加了真实的库存交互，必须在客户端和服务器上都安装。如果你只想在提示框中预览潜影盒内容，请查看客户端替代方案：</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shulker Box Tooltip</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/misterpemodder\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MisterPeModder</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 制作。💡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">也在使用收纳袋？来看看 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bundle-upgrade\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Bundle Upgrade</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，它为 Minecraft 的收纳袋也带来了同样的生活质量改进！🎒</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基于背包的存储访问：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 无需将支持的存储物品放置在世界中，即可直接在其中放入和取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">详细内容预览：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 直接在物品提示框中查看存储的内容，让你一目了然地了解每个存储物品中有什么。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">选择任何存储物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 使用滚轮或键盘方向键来选择你想要交互的存储物品，而非仅限于最新放入的那一个。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">所选物品详情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在浏览存储内容时，立即查看当前所选物品的附加信息。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品转移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 将物品点击到存储物品上，或将存储物品点击到背包格子中，以快速移入和移出内容。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨多个格子拖拽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 点击并拖拽穿过背包格子，以批量放入或取出物品，实现更快的库存管理。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精确物品移动：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Control</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Mac 上为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）可移动单个物品而非整组，精确控制转移数量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">存储填充指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可选择在支持的存储物品上显示收纳袋风格的填充条，以快速监控容量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智能兼容性指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 视觉提示显示持有的物品是否可以放入，以及内部是否已存在相同物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 自定义交互、控制、提示框行为和视觉特性，以匹配你偏好的游戏风格。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔗 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">数据包驱动的兼容性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可通过数据包添加对其他存储物品的支持，从而与许多模组背包和存储解决方案集成。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端和服务器均需要安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模组支持，可以在游戏内通过模组菜单直接进行配置（Fabric 上需要安装 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 制作）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如需使用外部文本编辑器手动配置，所有配置文件均位于 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，根据配置类型命名为 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。对于某个模组，可能并非所有类型都存在，甚至完全没有配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kir_antipov\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Kir_Antipov</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，其模组 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packed-inventory\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Packed Inventory</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 启发了末影箱功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrniddala\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MrNiddala</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，其灵感启发了通过在背包中拖拽容器物品至不同格子来放入或取出物品的功能。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bloomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bloomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/climate-rivers\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/climaterivers/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shroomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
